  "question": {
    "text": "Let a die be rolled <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math>&nbsp;times. Let the probability of getting odd numbers seven times be equal to the probability of getting odd numbers nine times. If the probability of getting even numbers twice is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mfrac></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>(getting odd <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> times) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi></math>(getting odd <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math> times).</p><p>This is the case of binomial distribution with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;successes and probability of success&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and failure is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mi>p</mi></mfenced><mi>k</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>q</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>9</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>times</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>even</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>16</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>14</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>"
  }
